{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 9, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler to the Land of the Rising Sun! A journey most grand awaits thee.\n\n**Day First: Arrival in Tokyo a City of Wonders**\n\nFrom whence thou art arrive at Narita's gate\nA bustling realm where fortunes congregate.\nTake the Narita Express a swift convey\nTo Shinjuku's heart where bright lights play.\nFind lodgings fit for a noble guest\nAnd feast upon ramen a savory test.\nExplore Shinjuku Gyoen a tranquil scene\nA verdant escape from urban sheen.\n\n**Day Second: Tokyo's Cultural Embrace**\n\nVisit the Meiji Shrine a sacred place\nWhere emperors pray with solemn grace.\nWander through Harajuku's vibrant street\nWhere youth's bold fashion doth ever meet.\nThen to Shibuya's crossing a sight to behold\nA human river bravely uncontrolled.\nAscend the Tokyo Skytree so tall\nAnd gaze upon the city encompassing all.\n\n**Day Third: Hakone's Mountain Majesty**\n\nJourney forth to Hakone a mountain's keep\nWhere art and nature secrets softly sleep.\nCruise Lake Ashi a mirror serene\nReflecting peaks of emerald green.\nRide the Hakone Ropeway a thrilling climb\nPast volcanic vents defying time.\nVisit the Hakone Open-Air Museum's art\nA masterpiece to capture the heart.\n\n**Day Fourth: Kyoto's Ancient Splendor**\n\nHie the train to Kyoto swiftly flies\nA city steeped in history before thine eyes.\nFind a ryokan a traditional home\nWhere tatami mats and gardens softly roam.\nVisit Fushimi Inari's vermilion gates\nA tunnel of dreams sealing destined fates.\nExplore Kiyomizu-dera a temple grand\nWith wooden stage overlooking all the land.\n\n**Day Fifth: Kyoto's Golden Pavilion**\n\nMarvel at Kinkaku-ji's golden gleam\nA shimmering vision a waking dream.\nWander through Arashiyama's bamboo wood\nA whispering forest understood.\nVisit Tenryu-ji a Zen retreat\nWhere peace and quiet souls can meet.\nEnjoy a tea ceremony a ritual rare\nA moment of stillness beyond compare.\n\n**Day Sixth: Nara's Deer and Temples**\n\nTake a train to Nara a city of grace\nWhere friendly deer roam at a leisurely pace.\nVisit Todai-ji Temple a sight to see\nHousing a giant Buddha for thee.\nExplore Kasuga Taisha with lanterns bright\nIlluminating pathways in fading light.\nObserve the deer bowing respectful low\nA charming spectacle a gentle flow.\n\n**Day Seventh: Departure a Fond Farewell**\n\nFrom Kansai International Airport depart\nWith memories etched forever in thy heart.\nOf temples shrines and gardens so fair\nA journey cherished beyond all compare.\nGo hence with joy and stories to impart\nOf Japan's wonders held within thy heart.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0021908108610659838}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3947389561508317e-05}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -0.5696897506713867}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.008129720576107502}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.11392349749803543}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -1.0513489246368408}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -1.1487016677856445}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -4.887569048150908e-06}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.00022289653134066612}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -0.0002195594133809209}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.30775824189186096}, {"token": "▁A", "logprob": -0.15097837150096893}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.11863165348768234}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.2896421253681183}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.14067289233207703}, {"token": "▁awaits", "logprob": -0.05627787858247757}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.034197624772787094}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.24657000601291656}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.12888112664222717}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.0018140303436666727}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.2351347804069519}, {"token": "▁First", "logprob": -1.1468034982681274}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -1.0466969013214111}, {"token": "▁Arrival", "logprob"